WEBVTT

00:00:02.144 --> 00:00:03.274
Welcome!

00:00:03.274 --> 00:00:04.874
Welcome to BABEL!

00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:08.504
Thanks to all the good little boys and
girls out there who watch this show!

00:00:08.784 --> 00:00:13.454
Today, we're going to tell you
all about us, The Doubleface!

00:00:13.454 --> 00:00:15.024
Huh? On our own? It's not in the script.

00:00:15.024 --> 00:00:16.354
It'll be fine!

00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:17.654
You're such a sneak!

00:00:17.654 --> 00:00:18.884
What?!

00:00:19.864 --> 00:00:25.064
First of all, I, with my short hair
and gentle manner, am Hotaru Nowaki.

00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:26.534
Gentle. Ri-i-ight...

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:28.404
Um, and I, with the long hair...

00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:31.834
and adorable almond-shaped
eyes, am Natsuko Tokiwa!

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.344
They're "adorable"?

00:00:33.344 --> 00:00:34.744
What about them?

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:37.334
Um, anyway, we're The Doubleface!

00:00:37.814 --> 00:00:39.574
Glad to meet you!

00:00:39.714 --> 00:00:42.284
And that's it! This is Hotaru Nowaki...

00:00:42.284 --> 00:00:43.874
and Natsuko Tokiwa signing off!

00:00:44.514 --> 00:00:51.614
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:00:52.624 --> 00:00:58.494
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:06.734
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:07.074 --> 00:01:11.944
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:13.214 --> 00:01:18.744
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:19.154 --> 00:01:23.744
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:24.354 --> 00:01:27.264
Limiter (changing myself)

00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:30.384
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:36.264
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.274
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:01:40.274 --> 00:01:43.104
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:01:43.344 --> 00:01:49.514
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:01:49.654 --> 00:01:52.454
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:01:52.454 --> 00:01:55.084
Sora e karitateru yo

00:01:55.084 --> 00:02:00.824
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:01.164 --> 00:02:06.694
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:18.744 --> 00:02:20.804
More than 60 years ago,

00:02:20.884 --> 00:02:24.814
precognitives created by
the army made a prediction.

00:02:25.184 --> 00:02:27.354
That, one day, antagonism between

00:02:27.354 --> 00:02:30.284
espers and Normals would spark a global war.

00:02:30.694 --> 00:02:32.924
Leading the war will be Major Hyobu!

00:02:33.524 --> 00:02:36.324
But eventually messiahs will appear

00:02:36.564 --> 00:02:41.724
who will lead all espers, not only us
in PANDRA, to victory and freedom.

00:02:47.374 --> 00:02:48.344
Seriously?

00:02:48.344 --> 00:02:49.614
They're pretty hot!

00:02:49.614 --> 00:02:50.944
Slim, with big boobs!

00:02:50.944 --> 00:02:52.134
No, one of them has little ones.

00:02:52.444 --> 00:02:55.384
At present, our queens look...

00:02:55.684 --> 00:02:56.304
like this.

00:02:57.984 --> 00:02:59.084
Them?

00:02:59.084 --> 00:03:00.924
A bunch of smart-ass little brats!

00:03:00.924 --> 00:03:03.754
It was because of them that
I had to leave BABEL!

00:03:03.754 --> 00:03:05.124
Right, Moga-chan?

00:03:05.124 --> 00:03:05.864
I'm Moga-chan, and they're a bunch of criminals!

00:03:05.864 --> 00:03:07.064
I prefer them like this!
I'm Moga-chan, and they're a bunch of criminals!

00:03:07.064 --> 00:03:07.894
Hey! Some of us here ARE criminals!
I'm Moga-chan, and they're a bunch of criminals!

00:03:07.894 --> 00:03:09.054
Hey! Some of us here ARE criminals!

00:03:10.064 --> 00:03:13.794
Uh-huh. So, that's why the
major's so interested to them.

00:03:14.104 --> 00:03:18.634
But isn't this weird?
If that prediction is 100% accurate,

00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:21.474
why don't we just wait for it to happen?

00:03:21.474 --> 00:03:23.174
Why interfere at all?

00:03:23.744 --> 00:03:27.044
Is he trying to change the future?

00:03:27.044 --> 00:03:28.604
Into what?

00:03:28.714 --> 00:03:29.914
Who knows?

00:03:30.584 --> 00:03:32.954
I'm sure he thinks deeply about this.

00:03:33.924 --> 00:03:34.714
Or possibly...

00:03:36.054 --> 00:03:36.854
Possibly?

00:03:38.054 --> 00:03:39.954
He isn't thinking about anything.

00:03:42.794 --> 00:03:44.954
34th sense: "Overrun With Pests!
Minamoto Uses His Hands and Feet!?"

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:49.434
The Precogs have just predicted an accident!

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:52.894
A large-scale biohazard contamination!

00:03:53.374 --> 00:03:53.934
Chief!

00:03:54.274 --> 00:03:55.794
Special espers, move out!

00:03:57.144 --> 00:03:58.274
Biological contamination?

00:03:58.814 --> 00:04:00.784
Even if you say there's a biohazard,

00:04:00.784 --> 00:04:03.944
we have no dangerous germs or animals here.

00:04:04.154 --> 00:04:06.214
Just rats and flies.

00:04:06.384 --> 00:04:11.094
Precog division reports a 70%
probability of it occurring.

00:04:11.094 --> 00:04:15.524
We're sending our best team!
Please cooperate with them.

00:04:29.314 --> 00:04:30.774
I know what they said, but you're overreacting...

00:04:30.774 --> 00:04:32.444
I'm It. Minamoto of BABEL.
I know what they said, but you're overreacting...

00:04:32.444 --> 00:04:36.114
Don't worry. I promise we'll change the future.

00:04:36.114 --> 00:04:36.884
But I said...

00:04:36.884 --> 00:04:37.814
Got the hazmat suits on?
But I said...

00:04:37.884 --> 00:04:38.904
Yes!

00:04:39.084 --> 00:04:41.224
Commence operations, Minamoto!

00:04:41.224 --> 00:04:41.954
Roger!

00:04:42.324 --> 00:04:44.054
The Children, released!

00:04:44.394 --> 00:04:45.324
All right!

00:04:47.964 --> 00:04:49.934
Healthy children are children of the wind!

00:04:50.034 --> 00:04:51.864
We won't be beaten by a virus!

00:04:51.864 --> 00:04:53.834
Always remember to wash your
hands and rinse your mouth!

00:04:53.834 --> 00:04:56.464
Okay, let's do this!

00:04:56.904 --> 00:04:57.834
Hold it!

00:04:57.934 --> 00:05:00.234
Where are your masks and
sleeves and long pants?

00:05:00.674 --> 00:05:02.074
This is cuter.

00:05:02.074 --> 00:05:04.414
You're going to beat a virus with cuteness?!

00:05:04.414 --> 00:05:06.884
Well, it's not like the incident's happened yet.

00:05:06.884 --> 00:05:09.384
There are no strange germs or
viruses at all at the moment.

00:05:09.384 --> 00:05:10.514
But still...

00:05:10.514 --> 00:05:13.614
It's fine! Cuteness makes us powerful!

00:05:13.984 --> 00:05:17.254
Idiot! The Children are national treasures!

00:05:17.254 --> 00:05:19.224
What will we do if anything goes wrong?!

00:05:19.594 --> 00:05:21.394
Exactly, Minamoto.

00:05:21.394 --> 00:05:22.524
Supervisor Tanizaki.

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:24.424
They need to wear their hazmat suits.

00:05:25.094 --> 00:05:27.034
Even if they say they don't want to!

00:05:27.034 --> 00:05:30.734
Absolute protection gear has to be worn
just in case something goes wrong!

00:05:30.734 --> 00:05:34.534
That's a supervisor's responsibility,
is it not, Minamoto?

00:05:35.344 --> 00:05:38.314
I made sure Naomi is wearing her hazmat suit!

00:05:38.314 --> 00:05:41.144
Come on, Wild Cat Naomi!

00:05:42.344 --> 00:05:45.914
A special skeleton hazmat suit made just for her!

00:05:45.914 --> 00:05:48.714
Ooh! This suit's sexy!

00:05:49.024 --> 00:05:51.424
Is that what you thought I'd say?!

00:05:51.494 --> 00:05:55.224
Oh, the pain! It tells me I exist in this world!

00:05:55.864 --> 00:05:58.134
His brain's got biological contamination.

00:05:58.134 --> 00:06:00.194
You can drop dead!
Apparently.

00:06:02.204 --> 00:06:02.934
Hey, what's wrong? What happened?!

00:06:02.934 --> 00:06:03.564
What's?!
Hey, what's wrong? What happened?!

00:06:03.634 --> 00:06:04.464
Mr. Minamoto!

00:06:07.444 --> 00:06:08.574
What's wrong, Kaoru?

00:06:08.574 --> 00:06:10.444
I-I suddenly have chills!

00:06:11.244 --> 00:06:12.814
Suddenly, so do I!

00:06:12.814 --> 00:06:15.444
Oh, look how we're dressed!

00:06:15.914 --> 00:06:19.254
Why didn't you try harder to stop us?

00:06:19.254 --> 00:06:21.274
You don't say?

00:06:21.384 --> 00:06:23.894
We're still a few minutes from the predicted time.

00:06:23.894 --> 00:06:25.484
This wasn't caused by contamination!

00:06:27.594 --> 00:06:31.364
But what, then? Think! It's almost time...

00:06:33.304 --> 00:06:35.134
How are things on your end,
Supervisor Tanizaki?

00:06:35.834 --> 00:06:39.774
The same. The researchers
are on the floor, out cold.

00:06:39.774 --> 00:06:40.894
Huh? There's a lump.

00:06:42.004 --> 00:06:43.674
Look, a lump.

00:06:43.674 --> 00:06:44.764
Look! On this one, too.

00:06:49.654 --> 00:06:51.314
Wh-What's?

00:06:58.224 --> 00:07:00.714
Could it be? Don't move, Kaoru!

00:07:09.204 --> 00:07:11.464
What are you doing?!

00:07:11.734 --> 00:07:13.004
What's going on?!

00:07:13.074 --> 00:07:13.934
Aoi!

00:07:14.404 --> 00:07:15.844
Clench your teeth!

00:07:18.114 --> 00:07:20.614
You hate me? Do you hate me all of a sudden?!

00:07:20.614 --> 00:07:22.144
Because we tease you with our ESP?!

00:07:22.144 --> 00:07:24.444
You'd hit kids just for that?!

00:07:24.854 --> 00:07:29.344
No! These people knocked each other out!

00:07:30.324 --> 00:07:33.484
They hit each other after flies landed on them!

00:07:35.624 --> 00:07:36.454
Damn!

00:07:46.604 --> 00:07:48.004
Sh-Shiho?

00:07:48.104 --> 00:07:49.904
Foolish humans.

00:07:50.314 --> 00:07:52.744
Your age is at an end!

00:07:52.744 --> 00:07:55.844
Now shall come the age of the flies!

00:07:56.254 --> 00:07:58.304
Shiho's been possessed!

00:08:00.084 --> 00:08:01.924
You humans are a threat to the Earth!
She's been possessed by a fly!

00:08:01.924 --> 00:08:03.454
You humans are a threat to the Earth!
Maybe it's her true feelings!

00:08:03.454 --> 00:08:04.524
Our vast numbers make us the more
suitable masters of the Earth!
Maybe it's her true feelings!

00:08:04.524 --> 00:08:07.284
Our vast numbers make us the more
suitable masters of the Earth!
Her true feelings are about
having a Age of the Flies?!

00:08:07.494 --> 00:08:07.824
Shiho!

00:08:07.824 --> 00:08:08.624
As of today, we declare war against humanity!
Shiho!

00:08:08.624 --> 00:08:10.634
As of today, we declare war against humanity!
Is this how you really think?!

00:08:10.634 --> 00:08:11.134
As of today, we declare war against humanity!
I said it's not her! That fly's causing it!

00:08:11.134 --> 00:08:13.724
I said it's not her! That fly's causing it!

00:08:14.134 --> 00:08:16.724
We have to free Shiho from its control!

00:08:20.674 --> 00:08:22.364
I'm pretty clear on the situation now.

00:08:23.114 --> 00:08:26.804
I don't need you anymore. Suffer and die.

00:08:28.544 --> 00:08:31.314
I used psychometry to link with it on purpose.

00:08:31.314 --> 00:08:33.614
But I was the one who was on top.

00:08:34.654 --> 00:08:35.524
Shiho...

00:08:35.524 --> 00:08:37.044
You scare me.

00:08:39.864 --> 00:08:42.934
In short, this facility was conducting research

00:08:42.934 --> 00:08:44.984
on the nerve circuitry of flies.

00:08:45.494 --> 00:08:46.664
Exactly.

00:08:46.664 --> 00:08:51.464
And one of the researchers here
was a latent telepath, huh?

00:08:51.934 --> 00:08:55.004
When an electronic signal
was sent into a fly's nerves,

00:08:55.004 --> 00:08:57.444
it looks like their consciousnesses
accidentally synchronized.

00:08:58.014 --> 00:09:01.984
The researcher's mind gained access
to the fly's external memories,

00:09:01.984 --> 00:09:04.414
producing something with human
intelligence and the will of a fly.

00:09:04.484 --> 00:09:08.084
A fly man who possesses telepathy, as well.

00:09:09.494 --> 00:09:12.354
Unfortunately, I don't know where he is now.

00:09:12.994 --> 00:09:14.424
Personality contamination.

00:09:14.424 --> 00:09:16.794
Is that what the prediction was actually about?!

00:09:16.864 --> 00:09:18.054
Wait, please!

00:09:18.534 --> 00:09:21.434
How does that explain what
happened to the staff here?

00:09:23.304 --> 00:09:25.994
Before he became a fly man,
his power level was low.

00:09:26.574 --> 00:09:28.304
I doubt he had any effect on humans.

00:09:28.744 --> 00:09:30.344
All the more reason he...

00:09:30.344 --> 00:09:32.884
But once he linked with the fly,

00:09:32.884 --> 00:09:35.444
he proved to be extremely compatible with it.

00:09:35.844 --> 00:09:38.874
So now, he can control any flies.

00:09:40.054 --> 00:09:41.954
Foolish humans!

00:09:44.554 --> 00:09:49.754
Contact with the flies seems to
spread the contamination. Like that.

00:09:50.534 --> 00:09:53.324
We can't do anything before
we get rid of Fly Man.

00:09:53.404 --> 00:09:56.494
You guys nearly got...
I mean, you were in danger.

00:09:57.304 --> 00:10:00.304
As espers, you'd offer a little resistance,

00:10:00.304 --> 00:10:02.844
but if Mr. Minamoto hadn't realized it,
things could have gotten funny...

00:10:02.844 --> 00:10:05.114
I mean, it would have been just awful!

00:10:05.114 --> 00:10:07.344
Whose side are you on?

00:10:07.784 --> 00:10:09.804
First, let's seal this place off.

00:10:09.984 --> 00:10:12.854
Then we'll send for insecticide
and kill all the flies before...

00:10:16.894 --> 00:10:17.594
BIOHAZARD:
In biological research, an
artificially produced pathogen.
Also used to indicate biological contamination.

00:10:17.594 --> 00:10:19.124
This is the story of how the
three young girls of the
special esper team The Children
dealt with a major biohazard.

00:10:19.124 --> 00:10:19.864
Zoom! Zoom!

00:10:19.864 --> 00:10:20.494
Moe! Moe!

00:10:20.494 --> 00:10:21.854
Fly! Fly!

00:10:25.134 --> 00:10:26.864
Huh? Oh. it's nothing.

00:10:34.544 --> 00:10:35.844
Foolish humans!

00:10:35.844 --> 00:10:36.464
Minamoto!

00:10:36.544 --> 00:10:38.474
Now begins the Age of the Flies!

00:10:40.284 --> 00:10:43.404
PSY-PSYCHIC TORNADO!

00:10:45.654 --> 00:10:47.084
Aoi, get us out of here!

00:10:47.084 --> 00:10:50.184
Not outside! They may have laid eggs on him!

00:10:54.264 --> 00:10:55.754
Well, for now...

00:10:57.994 --> 00:11:00.234
Oh, no! The men's room?!

00:11:00.234 --> 00:11:01.404
This is no time to be squeamish!

00:11:01.404 --> 00:11:04.474
No, that's the correct response
of a traditional Japanese lady!

00:11:04.474 --> 00:11:06.174
Keep it up, Naomi!

00:11:06.174 --> 00:11:07.194
Seal the door!

00:11:10.444 --> 00:11:11.914
So pretty...

00:11:15.714 --> 00:11:18.454
Don't! Don't stop acting like a human!

00:11:18.454 --> 00:11:19.824
Everyone, stop him!

00:11:19.824 --> 00:11:21.584
I didn't know Minamoto was into that.

00:11:21.584 --> 00:11:23.524
Don't talk like it's his hobby!

00:11:24.694 --> 00:11:27.524
What are you laughing at? You help, too!

00:11:27.524 --> 00:11:28.754
I can't take it anymore.

00:11:29.464 --> 00:11:30.894
Kyosuke Hyobu?!

00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:35.564
Mr. Hyobu? Momotaro?

00:11:35.564 --> 00:11:37.034
Why are you here?

00:11:37.034 --> 00:11:39.844
Nothing, really. Just came by to visit.

00:11:39.844 --> 00:11:42.174
And to see you at work.

00:11:42.804 --> 00:11:45.534
I never thought I'd get to
see something so funny!

00:11:46.344 --> 00:11:47.484
No!
One taste! All I need is one taste!

00:11:47.484 --> 00:11:48.284
Minamoto!
One taste! All I need is one taste!

00:11:48.284 --> 00:11:50.274
Think of your pride as one of the genius elite!
One taste! All I need is one taste!

00:11:54.354 --> 00:11:56.894
Quit laughing and do something!

00:11:56.894 --> 00:11:59.584
No. I'm not obliged to.

00:11:59.894 --> 00:12:01.984
Why don't you dump that loser and join me?

00:12:02.364 --> 00:12:05.734
Shut up! Be good to the ecology
and let me have a lick!

00:12:05.734 --> 00:12:09.164
I imagine the influence will fade
once you've taken care of Fly Man,

00:12:09.164 --> 00:12:11.304
but there's no guarantee.

00:12:11.304 --> 00:12:13.824
He might be stuck like this for the rest of his life.

00:12:14.174 --> 00:12:18.304
You people are nothing but
food producers for us!

00:12:18.874 --> 00:12:20.844
For the rest of his life?!
Everything you eat with your mouths,
we get from the other end!

00:12:20.844 --> 00:12:22.544
Everything you eat with your mouths,
we get from the other end!

00:12:25.754 --> 00:12:28.484
If worse comes to worst...

00:12:28.954 --> 00:12:30.544
I'll take care of him for the rest of his life!

00:12:37.064 --> 00:12:39.864
Look, Minamoto. Isn't the sunset pretty?

00:12:42.804 --> 00:12:46.134
I... I want to eat poop...

00:12:46.134 --> 00:12:48.934
Yes, Minamoto. The weather's lovely.

00:12:49.714 --> 00:12:53.944
Next week is your birthday.
Is there anything you'd like to eat?

00:12:53.944 --> 00:12:55.384
Wanna eat poop.

00:12:55.384 --> 00:12:58.184
Hamburger and fried shrimp? Sure thing!

00:13:01.184 --> 00:13:03.244
Did you know, Minamoto?

00:13:03.324 --> 00:13:06.314
They say there's going to be a war
between espers and Normals.

00:13:06.394 --> 00:13:07.924
Wanna eat poop.

00:13:07.924 --> 00:13:11.484
That's right, Minamoto.
It has nothing to do with us.

00:13:12.064 --> 00:13:13.664
Wanna eat poop.

00:13:13.664 --> 00:13:16.464
Yes, the sunset's very pretty.

00:13:19.574 --> 00:13:21.874
That... might be a problem.

00:13:21.944 --> 00:13:25.714
No! I don't wanna see
Mr. Minamoto talking about poop!

00:13:25.714 --> 00:13:28.314
I'll kill him and then kill myself!

00:13:28.314 --> 00:13:30.014
That would also be a problem.

00:13:30.614 --> 00:13:33.054
Then you'll just have to help us.

00:13:33.654 --> 00:13:36.624
Or do you not want to spend
the rest of your life as a man?

00:13:36.624 --> 00:13:40.354
That would especially be a problem.
Okay, I'll do it.

00:13:41.494 --> 00:13:45.094
You're a lucky man.
But I have one word of advice.

00:13:49.874 --> 00:13:52.034
Look! There he is!

00:13:53.644 --> 00:13:55.934
That's the main body of Fly Man!

00:13:57.914 --> 00:13:59.934
You're the only ones left.

00:14:00.044 --> 00:14:03.314
I won't let you lay a finger on Naomi!

00:14:05.054 --> 00:14:06.104
Whoa!

00:14:06.524 --> 00:14:08.854
No problem!

00:14:10.554 --> 00:14:11.524
No!

00:14:13.264 --> 00:14:15.664
Never touch me again!

00:14:15.664 --> 00:14:17.994
Cooties! Cooties!

00:14:19.164 --> 00:14:21.724
Stop! Mr. Minamoto, snap out of it!

00:14:21.804 --> 00:14:22.864
Momotaro.

00:14:23.274 --> 00:14:24.894
Leave it to me.

00:14:26.034 --> 00:14:29.944
Ah, no! Stop that! Mr. Minamoto, don't!

00:14:29.944 --> 00:14:32.434
No, don't touch me there! Stop it! Stop it!

00:14:36.084 --> 00:14:38.744
Ah... Nice workout!

00:14:40.184 --> 00:14:44.894
In the end, you couldn't even change a
minor prediction like this by yourself.

00:14:44.894 --> 00:14:46.084
Take this to heart!

00:14:47.194 --> 00:14:50.254
Well, I guess hoping things
will work out isn't enough.

00:14:53.064 --> 00:14:54.694
We've found you, Fly Man!

00:14:54.804 --> 00:14:55.894
Stop right there!

00:15:06.844 --> 00:15:08.284
Why're you bringing them here?!

00:15:08.284 --> 00:15:10.014
Stay away!

00:15:12.714 --> 00:15:15.024
Kaoru, don't! Keep your power low!

00:15:15.024 --> 00:15:16.594
If the glass breaks, they'll get out!

00:15:16.594 --> 00:15:17.144
Dammit!
If the glass breaks, they'll get out!

00:15:20.294 --> 00:15:21.854
Too low! Too low!

00:15:22.094 --> 00:15:22.954
You!

00:15:23.594 --> 00:15:25.424
It's breaking! It's breaking! It's too high!

00:15:26.394 --> 00:15:27.934
This is hard!

00:15:27.934 --> 00:15:30.664
It's harder than picking up
boiled tofu with chopsticks!

00:15:33.374 --> 00:15:34.394
We're surrounded!

00:15:34.874 --> 00:15:36.004
Can you teleport us?!

00:15:36.004 --> 00:15:41.044
Too much spatial noise!
You know that movie "The Fly"?

00:15:41.044 --> 00:15:44.744
It's about a teleportation failure
that fuses a fly with a man!

00:15:48.124 --> 00:15:49.714
Hey! How's it going?

00:15:50.154 --> 00:15:51.294
Mr. Hyobu?

00:15:51.294 --> 00:15:52.914
I assume you've found Fly Man.

00:15:53.024 --> 00:15:55.764
If you knock him out, the flies
will lose their intelligence.

00:15:55.764 --> 00:15:59.094
After you exterminate the flies,
I think we can treat him.

00:15:59.094 --> 00:16:01.624
Mr. Hyobu, help us! There are too many flies!

00:16:02.164 --> 00:16:05.934
Controlling my power... Oh, it's pissing me off!

00:16:05.934 --> 00:16:07.704
Then use wind.

00:16:07.704 --> 00:16:08.294
Wind?

00:16:08.904 --> 00:16:12.144
Apply your power indirectly
instead of directly on them.

00:16:12.274 --> 00:16:14.484
Try moving the air to create a wind.

00:16:14.484 --> 00:16:15.274
I see!

00:16:15.584 --> 00:16:18.674
PSYCHIC GOD BREATH!

00:16:26.394 --> 00:16:28.364
Okay! It's working!

00:16:32.534 --> 00:16:34.864
And a little bonus for the viewing audience...

00:16:36.064 --> 00:16:37.674
This is no time for fooling around!

00:16:37.674 --> 00:16:40.704
You're wearing the same thing, so
what's so interesting about it?

00:16:40.704 --> 00:16:42.834
How dare you do that to my people!

00:16:46.944 --> 00:16:48.204
Why, you!

00:16:48.784 --> 00:16:50.144
He's fast!

00:16:53.154 --> 00:16:53.814
Kaoru!

00:16:56.184 --> 00:16:58.214
Kaoru! We're retreating for now!

00:17:00.194 --> 00:17:02.494
You killed them without a thought!

00:17:02.494 --> 00:17:04.654
We're living things, too!

00:17:05.134 --> 00:17:08.764
Is that all your human intelligence
and feelings give you?

00:17:08.764 --> 00:17:10.974
Once you consider your opponents vermin,

00:17:10.974 --> 00:17:13.804
you wipe them out without any regret!

00:17:13.804 --> 00:17:16.504
Because you're literally vermin!

00:17:16.504 --> 00:17:20.134
Vermin that land on our food
after you touch poop!

00:17:20.484 --> 00:17:23.414
I'll show you the agony of dying as vermin, then!

00:17:23.414 --> 00:17:24.044
Shiho!
I'll show you the agony of dying as vermin, then!

00:17:24.654 --> 00:17:27.174
The agony of being killed as vermin?

00:17:31.354 --> 00:17:33.254
I already know what that's like.

00:17:33.254 --> 00:17:35.784
I don't need you to teach me about that.

00:17:36.464 --> 00:17:38.464
You're stronger than I expected.

00:17:38.464 --> 00:17:40.864
You've gained the flies' reflexes
as well, haven't you?

00:17:42.234 --> 00:17:45.034
Looks like you're a bit too much
for the little ones to handle.

00:17:57.454 --> 00:17:59.854
So, how do I play this?

00:17:59.854 --> 00:18:01.854
I don't think I can hit him with the gun.

00:18:01.854 --> 00:18:04.414
And this many flies might be
too much for even my ESP.

00:18:05.294 --> 00:18:07.324
Unless I can take them
all out in the same instant,

00:18:07.324 --> 00:18:09.814
he'll have time to act.

00:18:10.594 --> 00:18:12.294
Well, it can't be helped.

00:18:12.294 --> 00:18:15.424
For the sake of the queens, I'll have to risk it...

00:18:17.734 --> 00:18:21.674
Use the fire suppression system!
- Minamoto

00:18:22.204 --> 00:18:23.604
Minamoto!

00:18:29.884 --> 00:18:33.374
No! They're drowning! STOP IT!

00:18:34.154 --> 00:18:39.284
He used the last vestige of his will to
interfere with the flies' movements?

00:18:39.924 --> 00:18:40.864
Shiho!

00:18:40.864 --> 00:18:42.984
PSYCHIC...

00:18:44.664 --> 00:18:47.594
One of those things that catch flies, like this!

00:18:47.964 --> 00:18:51.064
They're called... Venus Flytraps...

00:18:51.604 --> 00:18:53.464
Fly Man capture, complete!

00:18:56.474 --> 00:19:01.584
Detergents contain chemicals that
weaken surface tension in liquids.

00:19:01.584 --> 00:19:04.984
It works wonders for killing bugs.

00:19:05.514 --> 00:19:08.924
I used to do this for fun all
the time when I was little.

00:19:08.924 --> 00:19:09.984
Sh-Shiho...

00:19:09.984 --> 00:19:10.974
So scary!

00:19:12.824 --> 00:19:16.454
Anyway, it's taken care of. Thanks for your...

00:19:20.704 --> 00:19:25.264
Your mission was to prevent a
biohazard from occurring.

00:19:25.774 --> 00:19:28.404
But you couldn't do it this time.

00:19:28.404 --> 00:19:33.644
Do you see? The prediction system
just lets you respond quickly.

00:19:33.644 --> 00:19:38.014
Perhaps your arrival here on site
was also part of the prediction.

00:19:38.684 --> 00:19:43.024
BABEL acts on predictions routinely,
always with the same result.

00:19:43.024 --> 00:19:45.324
You have no hope of changing the flow of events

00:19:45.324 --> 00:19:48.024
on an even more massive, global scale.

00:19:48.464 --> 00:19:50.934
There is only one future indicated now.

00:19:50.934 --> 00:19:53.534
And a Normal like you doesn't have the power

00:19:53.534 --> 00:19:55.464
to change a time stream so huge.

00:19:56.874 --> 00:19:59.504
I'll tell you how your life can be easier.

00:19:59.504 --> 00:20:03.804
Just go with the flow. I'll help you do it.

00:20:05.414 --> 00:20:08.104
I'll use my Hypno on you, full power.

00:20:08.484 --> 00:20:12.284
You'll forget that prediction, and about
the war between espers and Normals!

00:20:16.724 --> 00:20:18.654
I REFUSE!

00:20:19.154 --> 00:20:20.254
What?!

00:20:20.824 --> 00:20:23.024
Even if it's too much for me to do alone,

00:20:23.024 --> 00:20:25.864
if all of my comrades join me, we can do it!

00:20:25.934 --> 00:20:28.004
That's why BABEL exists!

00:20:28.004 --> 00:20:32.134
I think humans are stronger
than you say they are!

00:20:32.134 --> 00:20:37.944
Besides, most of my comrades
are espers, just like you!

00:20:47.224 --> 00:20:48.084
Minamoto!

00:20:52.094 --> 00:20:54.724
It's over. It's all over...

00:20:54.724 --> 00:20:55.264
Goodbye, my girlhood...

00:20:55.264 --> 00:20:57.064
Knock it off and help me!
Goodbye, my girlhood...

00:20:57.064 --> 00:20:57.584
Knock it off and help me!

00:20:58.894 --> 00:21:03.524
Don't be so naive.
Normals, joining forces to fight?

00:21:03.974 --> 00:21:04.774
Hurry and disinfect Minamoto!

00:21:04.774 --> 00:21:06.074
Get those flies killed, ASAP!
Hurry and disinfect Minamoto!

00:21:06.074 --> 00:21:06.804
Get those flies killed, ASAP!
The Three Second Rule applies,
even if he falls on the floor!

00:21:06.804 --> 00:21:07.974
ECM, ready to go!
The Three Second Rule applies,
even if he falls on the floor!

00:21:07.974 --> 00:21:08.744
ECM, ready to go!
Mr. Minamoto!

00:21:08.744 --> 00:21:13.474
The war between espers and Normals
is unavoidable, as it should be.

00:21:13.474 --> 00:21:14.344
But...

00:21:20.254 --> 00:21:24.554
It pains me to see those girls suffer.

00:21:25.394 --> 00:21:27.754
What are you up to?

00:21:28.364 --> 00:21:29.914
I've been looking for you.

00:21:29.994 --> 00:21:33.834
If you're gonna be boss of a criminal
organization, you need to work harder!

00:21:33.934 --> 00:21:37.024
You keep wandering off to play with
kids and I'll kill you, Grandpa!

00:21:37.434 --> 00:21:39.374
Is what Magi said.

00:21:39.474 --> 00:21:40.494
LIAR!

00:21:40.874 --> 00:21:42.744
That's clearly something you'd say!

00:21:42.744 --> 00:21:43.944
And who are you calling
grandpa, you little punk?!

00:21:43.944 --> 00:21:45.464
Can we just go home already?
And who are you calling
grandpa, you little punk?!

00:21:46.374 --> 00:21:49.044
I'll only use my powers to help other espers.

00:21:49.814 --> 00:21:52.014
Until this scar disappears.

00:22:01.464 --> 00:22:03.634
What are you doing there?

00:22:03.634 --> 00:22:05.234
Oh, nothing.

00:22:05.234 --> 00:22:07.004
We're worried about aftereffects.

00:22:07.004 --> 00:22:09.764
Never speak of it again!

00:22:21.384 --> 00:22:26.154
Kimi no tsuyogari wo gyuuto dakishimeta

00:22:26.154 --> 00:22:29.084
Setsunai yokogao sae zenbu

00:22:29.084 --> 00:22:31.454
I-TO-SHI-I

00:22:31.454 --> 00:22:35.664
Kabe wo kowasu tabi tsuyokunaru hito yo

00:22:35.664 --> 00:22:41.534
Boku no hitomi ni kurui wa nai

00:22:41.804 --> 00:22:46.834
Massugu sugiru mune no omoi

00:22:46.834 --> 00:22:50.344
Darenimo makenai kara

00:22:50.344 --> 00:22:55.644
Zettai kimi wo hanasanai donna toki mo

00:22:55.644 --> 00:23:00.824
Mada mienai LAST wa boku ga kaeyou

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.194
Akuma mo tenshi nimo tsubasa ga aru

00:23:05.194 --> 00:23:10.834
Motto takai sora e to michibikou

00:23:10.834 --> 00:23:15.504
Kore ijou egao wo kumorasenai

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:21.874
Tsunagaru kibou ga ima yami wo hikisaitara

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Kimi to tomo ni

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.714
Tobikoeru ashita e Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.124 --> 00:23:41.494
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.494 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:43.584
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.664 --> 00:23:45.184
Hatsune is quitting The Hound!

00:23:45.364 --> 00:23:47.354
Why do you hate me so much?

00:23:47.464 --> 00:23:48.964
I hate everything about you!

00:23:48.964 --> 00:23:51.004
I'll stop everything you do!

00:23:51.004 --> 00:23:53.174
Oh... Total rejection!

00:23:53.174 --> 00:23:54.704
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:54.704 --> 00:23:58.004
Episode 35. "Letting Your Feelings
Hang Out! Hatsune Runs Away!"

00:23:58.444 --> 00:24:01.534
Supervisor Kojika, you're wonderful!
Please don't quit!

00:24:01.644 --> 00:24:03.784
Any way you look at it, that's the cause, right?

00:24:03.784 --> 00:24:05.314
Poor Hatsune.

00:24:05.314 --> 00:24:06.184
Huh?

00:24:06.184 --> 00:24:06.854
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.854 --> 00:24:08.224
Letting Your Feelings Hang Out!
Hatsune Runs Away!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.224 --> 00:24:09.954
Letting Your Feelings Hang Out!
Hatsune Runs Away!
